---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---
<Layout active="about" title="About — NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM" description="About NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM, a Mauritanian trading company connecting Mauritania with international markets.">
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid two" style="align-items:center"><div><div class="kicker" data-en="About the company" data-es="Sobre la empresa" data-fr="À propos de l’entreprise">About the company</div><h1 class="h1" data-en="Mauritanian company, international commercial mindset." data-es="Empresa mauritana, mentalidad comercial internacional." data-fr="Entreprise mauritanienne, vision commerciale internationale.">Mauritanian company, international commercial mindset.</h1><p class="lead" data-en="Based in Nouakchott, NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM works to create practical connections between Mauritania and international companies looking for reliable opportunities." data-es="Con sede en Nuakchot, NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM trabaja para crear conexiones prácticas entre Mauritania y empresas internacionales que buscan oportunidades fiables." data-fr="Basée à Nouakchott, NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM crée des connexions pratiques entre la Mauritanie et les entreprises internationales recherchant des opportunités fiables.">Based in Nouakchott, NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM works to create practical connections between Mauritania and international companies looking for reliable opportunities.</p></div><div class="surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:34px"><p class="quote" data-en="We do not present ourselves as a catalogue. We work as a commercial bridge: understanding demand, identifying supply, and opening serious conversations." data-es="No nos presentamos como un simple catálogo. Trabajamos como puente comercial: entender la demanda, identificar oferta y abrir conversaciones serias." data-fr="Nous ne nous présentons pas comme un simple catalogue. Nous agissons comme un pont commercial : comprendre la demande, identifier l’offre et ouvrir des discussions sérieuses.">We do not present ourselves as a catalogue. We work as a commercial bridge: understanding demand, identifying supply, and opening serious conversations.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container"><SectionHeader kicker="How we work" kickerEs="Cómo trabajamos" kickerFr="Notre méthode" title="Simple, serious and focused on execution." titleEs="Simple, serio y centrado en la ejecución." titleFr="Simple, sérieux et orienté exécution." /></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container timeline"><div class="timeline-item"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="globe" /></div><h3 data-en="Market understanding" data-es="Conocimiento del mercado" data-fr="Compréhension du marché">Market understanding</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We start by understanding what the partner wants to buy, sell, import, export or represent." data-es="Empezamos entendiendo qué quiere comprar, vender, importar, exportar o representar el socio." data-fr="Nous commençons par comprendre ce que le partenaire veut acheter, vendre, importer, exporter ou représenter.">We start by understanding what the partner wants to buy, sell, import, export or represent.</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="document" /></div><h3 data-en="Commercial clarity" data-es="Claridad comercial" data-fr="Clarté commerciale">Commercial clarity</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We clarify product details, volumes, destinations, timelines and documentation before moving forward." data-es="Aclaramos detalles del producto, volúmenes, destinos, plazos y documentación antes de avanzar." data-fr="Nous clarifions produit, volumes, destinations, délais et documentation avant d’avancer.">We clarify product details, volumes, destinations, timelines and documentation before moving forward.</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="handshake" /></div><h3 data-en="Relationship building" data-es="Construcción de relaciones" data-fr="Construction de relations">Relationship building</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We introduce serious conversations and look for long-term cooperation instead of one-off promises." data-es="Abrimos conversaciones serias y buscamos cooperación a largo plazo en lugar de promesas puntuales." data-fr="Nous ouvrons des discussions sérieuses et recherchons une coopération durable plutôt que des promesses ponctuelles.">We introduce serious conversations and look for long-term cooperation instead of one-off promises.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container grid three"><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="trade" /></div><h3 data-en="Commercial agility" data-es="Agilidad comercial" data-fr="Agilité commerciale">Commercial agility</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We can evaluate different categories when the opportunity is serious and realistic." data-es="Podemos evaluar distintas categorías cuando la oportunidad es seria y realista." data-fr="Nous pouvons évaluer différentes catégories lorsque l’opportunité est sérieuse et réaliste.">We can evaluate different categories when the opportunity is serious and realistic.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="ship" /></div><h3 data-en="Sector focus" data-es="Enfoque sectorial" data-fr="Focus sectoriel">Sector focus</h3><p class="muted" data-en="Fisheries, maritime supplies, lubricants and resource-related opportunities are priority areas." data-es="Pesca, suministros marítimos, lubricantes y oportunidades relacionadas con recursos son áreas prioritarias." data-fr="Pêche, fournitures maritimes, lubrifiants et ressources sont des priorités.">Fisheries, maritime supplies, lubricants and resource-related opportunities are priority areas.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="check" /></div><h3 data-en="Reliability" data-es="Fiabilidad" data-fr="Fiabilité">Reliability</h3><p class="muted" data-en="Clear communication, discretion and realistic steps are central to our approach." data-es="Comunicación clara, discreción y pasos realistas son la base de nuestro enfoque." data-fr="Communication claire, discrétion et étapes réalistes sont au centre de notre approche.">Clear communication, discretion and realistic steps are central to our approach.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
